          "level": 1,
          "text": "P07.4 + P09.1 — Independent Review",
          "anchor": "p074-p091-independent-review",
          "githubAnchor": "p074-p091-independent-review",
          "stableAnchor": "h-847931489c39"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Tests run",
          "anchor": "tests-run",
          "githubAnchor": "tests-run",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9b92f4c9458f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "HIGH-1 — The close-time aggregation gate reads the definition from the REQUEST, not from the session. Bypassable through the public request door.",
          "anchor": "high-1-the-close-time-aggregation-gate-reads-the-definition-from-the-request-not-from-the-session-bypassable-through-the-public-request-door",
          "githubAnchor": "high-1-the-close-time-aggregation-gate-reads-the-definition-from-the-request-not-from-the-session-bypassable-through-the-public-request-door",
          "stableAnchor": "h-105001124465"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "MEDIUM-1 — Both contract documents promote the enforcement property that HIGH-1 shows does not hold.",
          "anchor": "medium-1-both-contract-documents-promote-the-enforcement-property-that-high-1-shows-does-not-hold",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-1-both-contract-documents-promote-the-enforcement-property-that-high-1-shows-does-not-hold",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c4308eb1732f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "MEDIUM-2 — P09.1: a `specialistSlots[].id` may collide with a declared `spec.actors[].id`, defeating the \"never routable\" guarantee in one direction and false-rejecting a legal edge in the other.",
          "anchor": "medium-2-p091-a-specialistslotsid-may-collide-with-a-declared-specactorsid-defeating-the-never-routable-guarantee-in-one-direction-and-false-rejecting-a-legal-edge-in-the-other",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-2-p091-a-specialistslotsid-may-collide-with-a-declared-specactorsid-defeating-the-never-routable-guarantee-in-one-direction-and-false-rejecting-a-legal-edge-in-the-other",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9c4da58a789b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "MEDIUM-3 — The forged-aggregate residual is recorded as \"structural\"; a cheap mitigation is in fact on the table, one layer below where the trace looked.",
          "anchor": "medium-3-the-forged-aggregate-residual-is-recorded-as-structural-a-cheap-mitigation-is-in-fact-on-the-table-one-layer-below-where-the-trace-looked",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-3-the-forged-aggregate-residual-is-recorded-as-structural-a-cheap-mitigation-is-in-fact-on-the-table-one-layer-below-where-the-trace-looked",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4e77943bc952"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "LOW-1 — The \"latest validated aggregation supersedes\" rule is not enforced atomically; the narrow race fails open.",
          "anchor": "low-1-the-latest-validated-aggregation-supersedes-rule-is-not-enforced-atomically-the-narrow-race-fails-open",
          "githubAnchor": "low-1-the-latest-validated-aggregation-supersedes-rule-is-not-enforced-atomically-the-narrow-race-fails-open",
          "stableAnchor": "h-40774f2f5aa9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "LOW-2 — P09.1: `requiredCapabilities: []` is accepted, contradicting the rule the code's own docstring states.",
          "anchor": "low-2-p091-requiredcapabilities-is-accepted-contradicting-the-rule-the-codes-own-docstring-states",
          "githubAnchor": "low-2-p091-requiredcapabilities-is-accepted-contradicting-the-rule-the-codes-own-docstring-states",
          "stableAnchor": "h-077937ce0eac"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "LOW-3 — The parity test's third comparison is close to vacuous.",
          "anchor": "low-3-the-parity-tests-third-comparison-is-close-to-vacuous",
          "githubAnchor": "low-3-the-parity-tests-third-comparison-is-close-to-vacuous",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f04fa17e5235"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "LOW-4 — `P07.4.md`'s headline Concern is now stale and should be struck.",
