        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "P08.2 — Independent Review (Session Ledger, Replay, And Visibility)",
          "anchor": "p082-independent-review-session-ledger-replay-and-visibility",
          "githubAnchor": "p082-independent-review-session-ledger-replay-and-visibility",
          "stableAnchor": "h-69ffbf192474"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Regression suite — reproduced independently",
          "anchor": "regression-suite-reproduced-independently",
          "githubAnchor": "regression-suite-reproduced-independently",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1389e1520f84"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Priority 1 — the caller-supplied-definition audit: **CLEAN, verified independently**",
          "anchor": "priority-1-the-caller-supplied-definition-audit-clean-verified-independently",
          "githubAnchor": "priority-1-the-caller-supplied-definition-audit-clean-verified-independently",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d2331f97dcbf"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Priority 3, 4, 5 — clean",
          "anchor": "priority-3-4-5-clean",
          "githubAnchor": "priority-3-4-5-clean",
          "stableAnchor": "h-facbfef680e6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Priority 2 — the new contribution-ownership check",
          "anchor": "priority-2-the-new-contribution-ownership-check",
          "githubAnchor": "priority-2-the-new-contribution-ownership-check",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7329568b0fe1"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-1 — A bare (unprefixed) contribution id is accepted as a disposition target, is reported by `show` as session-owned even when it names ANOTHER session's contribution, and silently resolves nothing",
          "anchor": "medium-1-a-bare-unprefixed-contribution-id-is-accepted-as-a-disposition-target-is-reported-by-show-as-session-owned-even-when-it-names-another-sessions-contribution-and-silently-resolves-nothing",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-1-a-bare-unprefixed-contribution-id-is-accepted-as-a-disposition-target-is-reported-by-show-as-session-owned-even-when-it-names-another-sessions-contribution-and-silently-resolves-nothing",
          "stableAnchor": "h-fdb14feba6fe"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-2 — Replay's open/resolved derivation is order-blind: a disposition appended BEFORE the link marks the contribution resolved, a state the write door refuses",
          "anchor": "medium-2-replays-openresolved-derivation-is-order-blind-a-disposition-appended-before-the-link-marks-the-contribution-resolved-a-state-the-write-door-refuses",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-2-replays-openresolved-derivation-is-order-blind-a-disposition-appended-before-the-link-marks-the-contribution-resolved-a-state-the-write-door-refuses",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8a9aafc7de2d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-3 — The Acceptance sentence \"window/context legality enforced\" holds only for the mediated door; the exported raw door is untested at that boundary",
          "anchor": "medium-3-the-acceptance-sentence-windowcontext-legality-enforced-holds-only-for-the-mediated-door-the-exported-raw-door-is-untested-at-that-boundary",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-3-the-acceptance-sentence-windowcontext-legality-enforced-holds-only-for-the-mediated-door-the-exported-raw-door-is-untested-at-that-boundary",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4ecaab67ae9f"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW-1 — `contributionId` has no shape constraint, so a `contribution:`-prefixed ref can carry path separators and a real foreign session id past the segment scan",
          "anchor": "low-1-contributionid-has-no-shape-constraint-so-a-contribution-prefixed-ref-can-carry-path-separators-and-a-real-foreign-session-id-past-the-segment-scan",
          "githubAnchor": "low-1-contributionid-has-no-shape-constraint-so-a-contribution-prefixed-ref-can-carry-path-separators-and-a-real-foreign-session-id-past-the-segment-scan",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4d5a43067e83"
        },
