          "githubAnchor": "v-002-work-is-optional-integration-not-system-identity",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4f580ee2e920"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "V-003: A Predeclared Workflow Or Protocol Is Optional",
